This product is a Rust port of "wasm-av1" (https://github.com/GoogleChromeLabs/wasm-av1),
Copyright 2018 Google LLC, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The decoder driving loop, IVF/blob data-source, frame ring buffer, YUV→RGB
conversion, WebGL renderer and demo page here derive from that project's
decode-av1.c, blob-api.c, yuv-to-rgb.c, draw-image.js and index.html.

It links, but does not include, the following at build time:
  rav1d            https://github.com/memorysafety/rav1d       BSD-2-Clause
                   (via https://github.com/safewords/rav1d, branch main — see docs/rav1d.md)
  rivet-container  https://github.com/rivet-transcoder/rivet   Open Encoding Attribution License 1.0
                   (optional, feature `container`; branch develop — see docs/rivet.md)
Their licence texts ship with their sources; a distribution that bundles a
built .wasm carries their notices as their licences require.
